# Pinned OpenSSL engine (ADR-001). Sourced by scripts/build-openssl.sh, the
# release workflow, and asserted by tests/engine.
#
# Update policy (ADR-007): check
# https://openssl-library.org/news/vulnerabilities/ regularly and before each
# release. If the pinned version is affected, bumping it here is top priority.
#
# 3.5.x is the LTS branch (EOL 2030-04-08) and is the first release with native
# ML-KEM / ML-DSA / SLH-DSA in the default provider.
#
# 3.5.7 (2026-06-09) is the latest 3.5.x patch release and the first without a
# known unpatched High-severity issue: 3.5.6 and earlier are affected by
# CVE-2026-45447 (heap use-after-free in PKCS7_verify).
OPENSSL_VERSION=3.5.7
OPENSSL_SHA256=a8c0d28a529ca480f9f36cf5792e2cd21984552a3c8e4aa11a24aa31aeac98e8
